# Yukariko

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Do not contradict it.

- Work GitHub issues **#1 through #19 in order**. Read Goal / Scope / Out of scope / Acceptance / Tests first.
- Implement only the current issue. Stub later behavior with an explicit error.
- Host Docker, Compose, and Git remain the source of truth.
- One binary. HTTP/UI are read-only. Reports cannot select commands.
- Do not build Coolify, Portainer, Kubernetes, proxies, remote execution, web YAML editing, automatic rollback, or health-based restarts.
- Do not create reserved `internal/*` packages before their owning issue.
- After an architecture decision, update `AGENTS.md` in the same change.
